<title>SOUTH AFRICA: St Helena Q1 distrib income 5.75 mln rand.</title>
<headline>St Helena Q1 distrib income 5.75 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable income		    5.75 vs 9.04</p>
<p>    Net income				  7.42 vs 9.30</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  1.67 vs 0.27</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 1,475 vs 1,400</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		230,000 vs 212,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     6.4 vs 6.6</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  44,527 vs 45,887</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     50,674 vs 55,873</p>
<p>Full name: St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
